<title>HONG KONG: Pacific Concord down on cool IPO response.</title>
<headline>Pacific Concord down on cool IPO response.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Pacific Concord Holdings Ltd fell following the cool response to the initial public offering (IPO) of shares of its spinoff property arm Concord Land Development Co Ltd, brokers said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The poor IPO response of its unit triggered selling,&quot; said Antony Mak, sales director at Vickers Ballas.</p>
<p>&quot;Investors took profits as they found no fresh excitement in the immediate run,&quot; said a research manager at a local brokerage. Concord Land's IPO was 1.53 times subscribed.</p>
<p>Pacific Concord shares fell HK$0.075, or 3.53 percent, to HK$2.05 at midday. -- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
